# A currency rather than litter: it sells for nothing, and one falls from every
# clear. The triangle says which stage of the game it belongs to and the colour
# which piece of the Root Abyss set it buys, so one glyph reads on both axes.
name: "Piece of Destruction"
category: ITEM_CATEGORY_ETC
kind: ITEM_KIND_TOKEN
description: "A scale torn from Chaos Vellum. The rock it fell on is still open."
currency_mark: "▲"
currency_color: CURRENCY_COLOR_THEME
